# ~/.config/sketchgen/fleet — the nodes bin/fleet knows (docs/plans/fleet.md).
# One per line: name, ssh host, and optionally the tunnel's local port and
# `billing` for a node on OCI. Only the first two are read by bin/fleet today.
#
# name      ssh host               port  flags
sld-cloud   sld-cloud              8081  billing
d12         d12-node-profcarroll   8082
d12-flux    d12-node-flux          8084
